	(lib_symbols)
	(text "32 application signals, including USART2 pivot Modbus; shared 3.3 V logic, isolated 5 V from PS4.\nEthernet / USB / SWD on this board. Field transceivers and isolation on the elevation board.\nJ31-13/14/18 are TX/RX/DE: mate matching P4.1 boards. Pin map: assembly/stack_interface.json."
